---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Abhi IT Solutions is a Hyderabad IT support team run by a system administrator with 5 years of experience.">
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>About Abhi IT Solutions</h1>
      <p>We are run by a system administrator with five years of hands-on experience managing computers, networks and servers.</p>
      <p>Our aim is simple: less IT downtime, scheduled preventive maintenance, clear monthly reports and affordable contracts for schools, colleges and training institutes.</p>
      <h2>Our commitment</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><h3>Reliable support</h3><p>Issues are logged, tracked and resolved in a timely way.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Transparent reporting</h3><p>You see what was fixed, what failed and what we recommend.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Secure operations</h3><p>Backups, updates and access controls are checked every month.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
